KHPAL GPS
Copyright (C) 2026 MK_MANDOKHAIL (modifications)

KHPAL GPS is a modified version of "GPS Setter" by @jqssun
(https://github.com/jqssun/android-gps-setter, 2024-2025), which is itself based on
"GPS Setter" by @Android1500 (https://github.com/Android1500/GPS-Setter, 2022-2023).

Modifications made in KHPAL GPS (summary):
 - renamed and rebranded (name, package com.khpalgps.zb, icon, About)
 - location provider follows the one Android supplies (no forced GPS)
 - new settings: per-provider accuracy, altitude, speed, MSL, horizontal/vertical accuracy,
   random-location radius and interval; old accuracy / random-position / update-check removed
 - map zoom buttons; key-free map tiles in the foss flavor

